== nosyserr CF
   |Ok
   |10 ON ERROR GOTO 90
   |20 CALL SYSTEM
   |30 PRINT "[BACK]":END
   |90 PRINT "ERR";ERR;"ERL";ERL:END
   |RUN
   |ERR 5 ERL 20
   |Ok
   |color   auto    goto    list    run
